  "id": "BIT-grafana-2026-111024",
  "summary": "Folder permission bypass in the Git Sync repository files API",
  "details": "A user with the Viewer or Editor role could bypass folder permissions on Git Sync managed resources through the repository files API: a Viewer could read files in folders they could not access, and an Editor could create, modify, move or delete provisioned dashboards and folders there (incorrect authorization).",
